**/Build/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/Plugins/**/Binaries/
**/Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Whitelist PakBlacklist-<BuildConfiguration>.txt files
!**/Build/*/PakBlacklist*.txt

# Keep icons in Build folder if needed
!**/Build/**/*.ico

# Built lighting/data for maps
*_BuiltData.uasset

# Precompiled source art
SourceArt/**/*.png
SourceArt/**/*.tga

